'''LE-47'''<ref name="Just Like Wes" /> was a [[LE-series droid]] who was owned by the [[Comet Runners]]. At some point during the [[High Republic Era]], [[Corr Taldaan]] and the Comet Runners were present at [[Yarrum Tower]] when they came across the pirate [[Cyrus Vuundir|Taborr Val Dorn]] who was showing off [[Jedi]] artifacts he stole from the droid [[0G-LC]]. The Comet Runners stole the artifacts from Val Dorn and planned to sell them on [[Crescent Island]], although they were thwarted by Val Dorn along with Jedi [[Jedi Initiate|initiates]] [[Kai Brightstar]], [[Lys Solay]], and [[Nubs]].<ref name="Team Up" />

